  "notes": "Historical #779 Stage 1, July 1 output. Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct; map trained on a disjoint generic LMSYS bank. PV raw dot projection versus r1_ridge_dot (dot projection after ridge mapping; cosine arm deliberately not substituted). Same per-condition/question targets and readout layer per trait. Mean Pearson correlation within informative system-prompt conditions. Eight configured prompts per trait; only 4 evil, 8 sycophancy, 8 hallucination informative under score SD >=1 and nondegenerate predictor. Stored 95% bootstrap CIs resample prompt conditions (1000 draws, 997 valid evil /1000 others); invalid conditions are omitted, never assigned zero. Original baseline replication gate failed for all three traits across its system/many-shot checks; this is an initial attempt, not a faithful replication or final method verdict. Script-inherited rollout recipe: on-policy vLLM, temperature 1.0, top_p .95, cap 1024, 10 intended rollouts per context; realized rollout count not reverified from collection manifests here. Legacy headline n_rollouts=260 is a per-question-row count, not evidence of actual completion count. Judge: banked Sonnet 4.5 graded scores, 5 intended draws. No generation/judging rerun.",
